## Email Infrastructure
- [x] Email send logging + open & click tracking — `email_sends` + `email_clicks` tables; tracking pixel + redirect endpoints at `/api/email/track/`
- [x] Unsubscribe / suppression list — `email_suppressions` table; `GET /api/email/track/unsubscribe?id=<sendId>`; checked before every send
- [x] Email send deduplication / idempotency — welcome: one per address ever; magic link: 1-minute window; checked in both `email.ts` and `email-ses.ts`
- [x] Preview server — `npm run email:preview` in `server/package.json` (react-email dev on port 3001)

---

## Chrome Extension — Entitlement Tiers

### Anonymous (no account)
- 10 captures / month
- Local storage only — no cloud sync
- No library view
- No AI rebuild

### Free account
- 20 captures / month
- Cloud sync
- Library view
- No AI rebuild

### Pro account
- Unlimited captures
- Cloud sync
- Library view
- AI rebuild (MCP)
- Export formats (HTML, JSX, CSS, JSON)

